  "raw_meta_yaml": "{% set version = \"8.3.7\" %}\n\npackage:\n  name: mongodb\n  version: {{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/archive/refs/tags/r{{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: d0179a61d3e126a6fce328db38e5f7568f24dfb1a33748d1b994b7fe641c7d88\n  patches:\n    - patches/0001-Disable-mongo_apple_toolchain-registration-for-native-macOS-builds.patch  # [osx]\n    - patches/0002-Make-tool_to_path-basename-check-tolerate-cross-prefixed-compilers.patch\n    - patches/0003-mozjs-gate-wrapper-comparison-operators-ElementType-behind-DefineComparisonOps-for-MSVC-14.4x.patch  # [win]\n    - patches/0004-mozjs-constrain-ProtectedData-for-C-20-MSVC-14.4x.patch  # [win]\n    - patches/0005-resharding_util-split-deeply-nested-pipeline-literals-to-avoid-MSVC-C1060.patch  # [win]\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  # MongoDB distributes ppc64le only for Enterprise Edition\n  skip: true  # [ppc64le]\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - {{ compiler('c') }}\n    - {{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - {{ stdlib('c') }}\n    # 8.0's .bazelversion pins bazel 7.5; 7.6+ drops flags mongo's .bazelrc uses.\n    - bazel =7.5\n    - bazel-toolchain  # [not win]\n    - python >=3.10\n    - pip\n    # Provides rg for the .auto_header generator invoked from build.sh, which\n    # calls it via RG_PATH. Without this package that step fails.\n    - ripgrep\n  host:\n    - openssl\n    - libcurl\n    - cyrus-sasl\n\ntest:\n  commands:\n    - mongod --version\n    - mongos --version\n    - mongod --help\n    - mongos --help\n\nabout:\n  home: https://www.mongodb.com/\n  license: SSPL-1.0\n  license_family: OTHER\n  # mongod/mongos statically link all vendored third-party libs. Per\n  # README.third_party.md these are covered by mongo's consolidated\n  # distsrc/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES or each lib's own LICENSE (below). folly and\n  # zstd are not in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES (added with the Bazel build), so their\n  # LICENSE files are listed explicitly.\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE-Community.txt\n    - distsrc/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES\n    - README.third_party.md\n    - src/third_party/abseil-cpp/dist/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/fmt/dist/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/folly/dist/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/gperftools/dist/COPYING\n    - src/third_party/icu4c-57.1/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/immer/dist/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/IntelRDFPMathLib20U1/eula.txt\n    - src/third_party/libbson/dist/COPYING\n    - src/third_party/pcre2/LICENCE\n    - src/third_party/s2/LICENSE-2.0.txt\n    - src/third_party/snappy/dist/COPYING\n    - src/third_party/tcmalloc/dist/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/timelib/dist/LICENSE.rst\n    - src/third_party/tomcrypt-1.18.2/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/unwind/dist/COPYING\n    - src/third_party/wiredtiger/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/yaml-cpp/yaml-cpp/LICENSE\n    - src/third_party/zstandard/zstd/COPYING\n  summary: The MongoDB Database\n  description: |\n    MongoDB is a general-purpose, document-based, distributed database built\n    for modern application developers and for the cloud era. This package\n    provides the community edition `mongod` server and `mongos` router.\n    The legacy `mongo` shell was removed in MongoDB 8.0.\n  doc_url: https://docs.mongodb.com/\n  dev_url: https://github.com/mongodb/mongo\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - nehaljwani\n    - h-vetinari\n    - tropicrainforest\n",
